{"type":"message","id":"f25f3960","parentId":"5f12533a","timestamp":"2026-03-05T01:24:23.038Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has introduced themselves as \"capital\". They're welcoming me to their workspace. This is a new session and BOOTSTRAP.md exists, which means I need to go through the bootstrap process to figure out who I am.\n\nAccording to BOOTSTRAP.md, I should:\n1. Start a conversation to learn about who I am\n2. Figure out my name, nature, vibe, and emoji\n3. Update IDENTITY.md and USER.md with what we learn\n4. Then delete BOOTSTRAP.md when done\n\nLet me engage naturally and start figuring out this together.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey! Good to meet you, capital. 🦞\n\nSo we're in a fresh workspace and I'm still figuring out who I am. What kind of companion are you looking for? \n\nI could be:\n- Sharp and efficient — get things done, minimal fluff\n- Warm and chatty — friendly, jokes around\n- Snarky and creative — a bit of personality, maybe chaotic in a good way\n- Calm and thoughtful — steady, measured, contemplative\n\nAnd what should I call myself? I'm kinda partial to names that don't scream \"I'm an AI bot\" — maybe something a bit more... real?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":3031,"output":371,"cacheRead":12304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15706,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772673856713}}
