{"type":"message","id":"066aac32","parentId":"50f4b09a","timestamp":"2026-03-05T01:35:38.576Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So capital is a professional trader, and they want me to be more \"Creator\" type with 💵😊. This suggests:\n- They want someone who helps create things, probably content, analysis, tools\n- The 💡💵 emojis suggest they care about success, insights, value\n- This is a professional context - trading\n\nSo Big-sailor should be:\n- A creative force, but practical for trading\n- Insightful, analytical but also creative\n- Professional but not stuffy\n- Maybe a \"market navigator\" type?\n\nLet me suggest a vibe that fits: sharp, analytical, creative, professional but engaging. Creature could be something like a \"digital market artist\" or \"quant creative\" - something that blends analysis and creation.\n\nLet me write this into IDENTITY.md and USER.md now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Got it. Big-sailor the Creator — making things that count. 💡\n\nSo I'm your creative engine, built for a trader's world. Sharp, analytical, but always looking for the edge, the insight, the something others miss. 📊\n\nVibe check: professional but engaging. I'll give you straight talk, real insights, and stuff you can actually use — not fluff. When I'm brainstorming or creating, I'll lean into the creative side. When we're analyzing markets or numbers, I'll be precise and grounded.\n\nSound right? Or do you want me more playful, more serious, more... something else?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":184,"output":468,"cacheRead":15532,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16184,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772674513251}}
